1. Objective:
The goal of this Labwork is to install MySQL and clone the repo test_db
from github, then import the database, and verify it.

2. Execution

Task 1: Clone the repo
- Command: 
git clone https://github.com/datacharmer/test_db
cd test_db

Task 2: Import Dataset into MySQL
- Command:
mysql -u root -p --commands < employees.sql

Task 3: Verify database
- Command:
mysql -u root -p --commands -t < test_employees_sha2.sql

3. Conclusion
All 6 tablews (employees, departments, dept_manager, dept_emp, 
titles, salaries) were successfully installed and verified 
with matching checksums (OK status).